#  AMAZON-page clone

This is simple HTML and CSS project that recreat an AMAZON style page.It display banner, navigation menu and products categories with responsive layouts.

---

## Features 

- Navigation bar with saerch and links
- Banner section
- product categories
- style layout 

--- 

## Technologies Used 

- **HTML**     for structure
- **CSS**     for styling and layout

---

## How to Run 
1. Clone this repository:
```bash
git clone https://github.com/Amnaakhtar1213/amazon-page-clone.git